{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Cadre Contacts 是專為整理 Apple Contacts 而設的聯絡人管理工具，能找出重複項目、檢查資料完整性並提供修正建議，適合多年累積聯絡人、曾從多個帳戶匯入資料，或通訊錄逐漸混亂的 iPhone、iPad 及 Mac 使用者。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-17.webp\">\n<h2>跨帳戶找出重複聯絡人</h2>\n<p>Cadre 會為整本通訊錄評分，並跨 iCloud、Google、Exchange 等帳戶找出重複聯絡人，逐一比對姓名、電話、電郵、公司與地址；同時檢查 240 多個國家及地區的電話格式、電郵與地址問題，提供可套用或忽略的智能修正建議。所有分析均在使用者裝置上完成，另支援匯出備份、30 日內還原刪除項目及智能列表。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1080x2340bb-6.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1080x2340bb-7.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1080x2340bb-8.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1080x2340bb-9.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1080x2340bb-10.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1080x2340bb-11.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Cadre Contacts</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T22:39:15.423731+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":365,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T03:17:57.852222+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T22:37:48.305271+00:00","content_hash":"646bc7e4802d402ead713f85fe334475abab2e9129430fbf511956fe69d66dde","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}